  "title": "Quick Cinnamon Almond Mug Cake",
  "blurb": "A single-serving cake you can make in a mug in the microwave when you want something sweet and warm straight away.",
  "steps": [
    "Put the almond flour, coconut sugar and cinnamon in a microwave-safe mug and stir together.",
    "Crack in the egg and add the oil, then beat everything together with a fork until smooth.",
    "Microwave on high for 60 to 75 seconds until the cake has risen and set in the centre.",
    "Let it cool for a minute before eating straight from the mug."
